Package: wifi-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-keyring, python3-psutil, python3-tk, python3-jeepney, python3-secretstorage
Suggests: gnome-keyring, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Maintainer: Akshaj Tiwari <akshajtiwari9a@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/akshajtiwari/Wifi-Agent
Description: automatic Sophos/Cyberoam captive-portal login for wired networks
 WiFi Agent watches the wired connection, signs back in to the campus or
 office captive portal whenever the session ends, and shows its state in
 the system tray with desktop notifications.
 .
 The password is kept in the Secret Service keyring (GNOME Keyring or
 KWallet) when one is available, otherwise in a file readable only by the
 user.
